{"componentChunkName":"component---src-templates-post-template-tsx","path":"/view-transitions-api-guide/","result":{"data":{"allMarkdownRemark":{"edges":[{"node":{"html":"<h1>🎬 View Transitions API: SPA와 MPA를 아우르는 차세대 브라우저 애니메이션 혁명</h1>\n<blockquote>\n<p>복잡한 JS 라이브러리 없이 브라우저 네이티브 엔진만으로 부드러운 화면 전환을 구현하다.\nSPA 내부 상태 변화부터 MPA 페이지 이동까지 완벽하게 처리하는 View Transitions API의 모든 것.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2>📌 목차</h2>\n<ol>\n<li>🧭 View Transitions API란 무엇인가?</li>\n<li>⚙️ 동작 원리: 브라우저 가상 요소(Pseudo-elements)의 비밀</li>\n<li>🚀 SPA에서 View Transitions 적용하기 (<code class=\"language-text\">document.startViewTransition</code>)</li>\n<li>🌐 MPA(Multi-Page Application) 간 Cross-Document View Transitions</li>\n<li>🎨 <code class=\"language-text\">view-transition-name</code>을 활용한 요소 단위 전환 (Hero Animation)</li>\n<li>📊 기존 애니메이션 솔루션과의 비교</li>\n<li>🛠️ 프레임워크(React / Next.js) 통합 및 커스텀 CSS 커스스터마이징</li>\n<li>⚠️ 실무 함정 1: 레이아웃 스태킹 및 z-index context 꼬임 현상</li>\n<li>⚠️ 실무 함정 2: 비동기 데이터 패칭 및 DOM 업데이트 타이밍 미스</li>\n<li>🚫 사용을 피해야 하는 상황과 성능 안티 패턴</li>\n<li>🧭 접근성(a11y)과 <code class=\"language-text\">prefers-reduced-motion</code> 대책</li>\n<li>🧾 정리</li>\n</ol>\n<hr>\n<h2>🧭 1. View Transitions API란 무엇인가?</h2>\n<p>과거 웹 애플리케이션에서 페이지를 전환하거나 상태를 변경할 때 네이티브 앱과 같은 부드러운 애니메이션을 구현하는 것은 대단히 까다로운 작업이었습니다. <code class=\"language-text\">Framer Motion</code>, <code class=\"language-text\">GSAP</code>, <code class=\"language-text\">React Transition Group</code> 같은 외부 라이브러리를 사용하여 구 상태와 신 상태의 DOM 노드를 한 번에 유지하고, 절대 좌표(<code class=\"language-text\">position: absolute</code>)를 계산하여 트랜지션을 부여해야 했습니다.</p>\n<p><code class=\"language-text\">View Transitions API</code>는 이러한 복잡성을 브라우저 렌더링 엔진 자체로 가져왔습니다. 개발자는 DOM 업데이트 로직만 전달하고, 브라우저가 변경 전후의 렌더링 스냅샷을 캡처하여 GPU 가속 기반의 가상 요소(Pseudo-elements) 트리를 생성합니다.</p>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 768px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/e70cb0489ec83cae32a982702deb17a2/bbbf7/view-transitions-api-guide-1.png\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 50%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <picture>\n          <source\n              srcset=\"/static/e70cb0489ec83cae32a982702deb17a2/a59e9/view-transitions-api-guide-1.webp 192w,\n/static/e70cb0489ec83cae32a982702deb17a2/0ca9f/view-transitions-api-guide-1.webp 384w,\n/static/e70cb0489ec83cae32a982702deb17a2/dc9b9/view-transitions-api-guide-1.webp 768w,\n/static/e70cb0489ec83cae32a982702deb17a2/e2c2f/view-transitions-api-guide-1.webp 1152w,\n/static/e70cb0489ec83cae32a982702deb17a2/94b1e/view-transitions-api-guide-1.webp 1280w\"\n              sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 768px\"\n              type=\"image/webp\"\n            />\n          <source\n            srcset=\"/static/e70cb0489ec83cae32a982702deb17a2/3b721/view-transitions-api-guide-1.png 192w,\n/static/e70cb0489ec83cae32a982702deb17a2/66595/view-transitions-api-guide-1.png 384w,\n/static/e70cb0489ec83cae32a982702deb17a2/fe486/view-transitions-api-guide-1.png 768w,\n/static/e70cb0489ec83cae32a982702deb17a2/d2d74/view-transitions-api-guide-1.png 1152w,\n/static/e70cb0489ec83cae32a982702deb17a2/bbbf7/view-transitions-api-guide-1.png 1280w\"\n            sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 768px\"\n            type=\"image/png\"\n          />\n          <img\n            class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n            src=\"/static/e70cb0489ec83cae32a982702deb17a2/fe486/view-transitions-api-guide-1.png\"\n            alt=\"기존 JS 애니메이션과 View Transitions API 비교\"\n            title=\"\"\n            loading=\"lazy\"\n            decoding=\"async\"\n            style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n          />\n        </picture>\n  </a>\n    </span></p>\n<hr>\n<h2>⚙️ 2. 동작 원리: 브라우저 가상 요소(Pseudo-elements)의 비밀</h2>\n<p><code class=\"language-text\">document.startViewTransition()</code>이 호출되면 브라우저는 다음과 같은 단계로 가상 렌더링 트리를 구축합니다.</p>\n<ol>\n<li>현재 상태의 화면을 <strong>Old 스냅샷 이미지</strong>로 캡처합니다.</li>\n<li>전달된 콜백 함수를 실행하여 실제 DOM을 변경합니다.</li>\n<li>변경 완료 후 새로운 상태의 화면을 <strong>New 스냅샷 이미지</strong>로 캡처합니다.</li>\n<li>브라우저 루트 최상위에 <code class=\"language-text\">::view-transition</code> 가상 요소 트리를 생성합니다.</li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"text\"><pre class=\"language-text\"><code class=\"language-text\">::view-transition\n└─ ::view-transition-group(root)\n   └─ ::view-transition-image-pair(root)\n      ├─ ::view-transition-old(root)   &lt;-- 이전 상태 캡처\n      └─ ::view-transition-new(root)   &lt;-- 이후 상태 캡처</code></pre></div>\n<p>기본적으로 <code class=\"language-text\">::view-transition-old</code>는 opacity 1에서 0으로, <code class=\"language-text\">::view-transition-new</code>는 opacity 0에서 1로 변하는 Cross-fade 애니메이션이 적용됩니다.</p>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 768px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/bda1220e26c92890a7c0b9abc110aaef/bbbf7/view-transitions-api-guide-2.png\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 50%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <picture>\n          <source\n              srcset=\"/static/bda1220e26c92890a7c0b9abc110aaef/a59e9/view-transitions-api-guide-2.webp 192w,\n/static/bda1220e26c92890a7c0b9abc110aaef/0ca9f/view-transitions-api-guide-2.webp 384w,\n/static/bda1220e26c92890a7c0b9abc110aaef/dc9b9/view-transitions-api-guide-2.webp 768w,\n/static/bda1220e26c92890a7c0b9abc110aaef/e2c2f/view-transitions-api-guide-2.webp 1152w,\n/static/bda1220e26c92890a7c0b9abc110aaef/94b1e/view-transitions-api-guide-2.webp 1280w\"\n              sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 768px\"\n              type=\"image/webp\"\n            />\n          <source\n            srcset=\"/static/bda1220e26c92890a7c0b9abc110aaef/3b721/view-transitions-api-guide-2.png 192w,\n/static/bda1220e26c92890a7c0b9abc110aaef/66595/view-transitions-api-guide-2.png 384w,\n/static/bda1220e26c92890a7c0b9abc110aaef/fe486/view-transitions-api-guide-2.png 768w,\n/static/bda1220e26c92890a7c0b9abc110aaef/d2d74/view-transitions-api-guide-2.png 1152w,\n/static/bda1220e26c92890a7c0b9abc110aaef/bbbf7/view-transitions-api-guide-2.png 1280w\"\n            sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 768px\"\n            type=\"image/png\"\n          />\n          <img\n            class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n            src=\"/static/bda1220e26c92890a7c0b9abc110aaef/fe486/view-transitions-api-guide-2.png\"\n            alt=\"View Transitions 라이프사이클 흐름도\"\n            title=\"\"\n            loading=\"lazy\"\n            decoding=\"async\"\n            style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n          />\n        </picture>\n  </a>\n    </span></p>\n<hr>\n<h2>🚀 3. SPA에서 View Transitions 적용하기 (<code class=\"language-text\">document.startViewTransition</code>)</h2>\n<p>단일 페이지 애플리케이션(SPA)에서는 DOM 변경 코드를 <code class=\"language-text\">document.startViewTransition</code> 콜백으로 감싸는 것만으로 즉시 동작합니다.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"js\"><pre class=\"language-js\"><code class=\"language-js\"><span class=\"token comment\">// View Transitions API 지원 여부 확인 분기</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">function</span> <span class=\"token function\">updateDOM</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n  document<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">getElementById</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">'content'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>textContent <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token string\">'새로운 페이지 콘텐츠입니다!'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n\n<span class=\"token keyword\">function</span> <span class=\"token function\">navigate</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n  <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token operator\">!</span>document<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>startViewTransition<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"token comment\">// 미지원 브라우저는 폴백 처리</span>\n    <span class=\"token function\">updateDOM</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n\n  <span class=\"token comment\">// 브라우저가 화면을 캡처하고 애니메이션 트리거</span>\n  <span class=\"token keyword\">const</span> transition <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> document<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">startViewTransition</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=></span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"token function\">updateDOM</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n\n  transition<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>ready<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">then</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=></span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n    console<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">log</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">'가상 애니메이션 요소를 사용할 준비가 되었습니다.'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n\n  transition<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>finished<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">then</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=></span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n    console<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">log</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">'트랜지션이 완전히 끝났습니다.'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></code></pre></div>\n<hr>\n<h2>🌐 4. MPA(Multi-Page Application) 간 Cross-Document View Transitions</h2>\n<p>Chrome 126부터는 SPA뿐만 아니라 동일 출처(Same-Origin)의 MPA 간 페이지 이동 시에도 CSS 설정만으로 브라우저 수준 트랜지션을 지원합니다.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"css\"><pre class=\"language-css\"><code class=\"language-css\"><span class=\"token comment\">/* origin 및 target 문서 양쪽 모두의 CSS에 선언해야 동작합니다 */</span>\n<span class=\"token atrule\"><span class=\"token rule\">@view-transition</span></span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n  <span class=\"token property\">navigation</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> auto<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></code></pre></div>\n<p>별도의 JavaScript 코딩 없이 <code class=\"language-text\">&lt;a></code> 태그 클릭을 통한 페이지 전환 시에도 자연스러운 배너 공유, 이미지 트랜지션 등이 이루어집니다.</p>\n<hr>\n<h2>🎨 5. <code class=\"language-text\">view-transition-name</code>을 활용한 요소 단위 전환 (Hero Animation)</h2>\n<p>전체 화면 교체 외에 특정 개별 요소를 매칭하여 부드럽게 위치와 크기를 변환(Shared Element Transition)할 수 있습니다.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"css\"><pre class=\"language-css\"><code class=\"language-css\"><span class=\"token comment\">/* 목록 페이지의 이미지 카테고리 */</span>\n<span class=\"token selector\">.card-image</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n  <span class=\"token property\">view-transition-name</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> product-hero<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n\n<span class=\"token comment\">/* 상세 페이지의 메인 헤더 이미지 */</span>\n<span class=\"token selector\">.detail-hero-image</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n  <span class=\"token property\">view-transition-name</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> product-hero<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></code></pre></div>\n<p>두 페이지 혹은 두 상태에서 동일한 <code class=\"language-text\">view-transition-name</code>을 가진 요소가 존재하면, 브라우저는 해당 요소의 Rect(위치, 크기) 차이를 자동 계산하여 무결점 Transform 애니메이션을 연출합니다.</p>\n<hr>\n<h2>📊 6. 기존 애니메이션 솔루션과의 비교</h2>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\">구분</th>\n<th align=\"left\">기존 JS 라이브러리 (Framer/GSAP)</th>\n<th align=\"left\">View Transitions API</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>렌더링 방식</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\">실제 DOM 노드 복제 및 JS 좌표 계산</td>\n<td align=\"left\">브라우저 렌더러 수준 스냅샷 이미지 처리</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>메인 스레드 부하</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\">높음 (스크립트 실행 및 Reflow 지속 발생)</td>\n<td align=\"left\">매우 낮음 (GPU Compositor 스레드 활용)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>MPA 지원</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\">불가능</td>\n<td align=\"left\"><code class=\"language-text\">@view-transition</code>으로 완전 지원</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>번들 사이즈</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\">30KB ~ 100KB+ 가중</td>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>0 KB</strong> (웹 표준 API)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>복잡도</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\">AnimatePresence 등 리액트 트리 관리 필요</td>\n<td align=\"left\">단순 CSS <code class=\"language-text\">view-transition-name</code> 명시</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<hr>\n<h2>🛠️ 7. 프레임워크(React / Next.js) 통합 및 커스텀 CSS 커스텀</h2>\n<p>React 19 및 Next.js App Router 환경에서는 <code class=\"language-text\">flushSync</code>와 함께 사용하거나 커스텀 훅으로 추상화할 수 있습니다.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"jsx\"><pre class=\"language-jsx\"><code class=\"language-jsx\"><span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span> flushSync <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"token string\">'react-dom'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span> useState <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"token string\">'react'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n\n<span class=\"token keyword\">export</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">function</span> <span class=\"token function\">useViewTransition</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n  <span class=\"token keyword\">const</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>isPending<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> setIsPending<span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token function\">useState</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token boolean\">false</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n\n  <span class=\"token keyword\">const</span> <span class=\"token function-variable function\">startTransition</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token parameter\">callback</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=></span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token operator\">!</span>document<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>startViewTransition<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n      <span class=\"token function\">callback</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n      <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n\n    <span class=\"token function\">setIsPending</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token boolean\">true</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">const</span> transition <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> document<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">startViewTransition</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=></span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n      <span class=\"token function\">flushSync</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=></span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n        <span class=\"token function\">callback</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n      <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n\n    transition<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>finished<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">finally</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=></span> <span class=\"token function\">setIsPending</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token boolean\">false</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n\n  <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span> startTransition<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> isPending <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></code></pre></div>\n<p>CSS를 이용해 기본 애니메이션 속도와 이징(easing)도 손쉽게 제어할 수 있습니다.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"css\"><pre class=\"language-css\"><code class=\"language-css\"><span class=\"token comment\">/* 슬라이드 좌우 이동 커스텀 트랜지션 */</span>\n<span class=\"token selector\">::view-transition-old(slide-card)</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n  <span class=\"token property\">animation</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> 300ms ease-out <span class=\"token function\">cubic-bezier</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>0.4<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> 0<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> 0.2<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> 1<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> slide-to-left<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n<span class=\"token selector\">::view-transition-new(slide-card)</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n  <span class=\"token property\">animation</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> 300ms ease-out <span class=\"token function\">cubic-bezier</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>0.4<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> 0<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> 0.2<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> 1<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> slide-from-right<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n\n<span class=\"token atrule\"><span class=\"token rule\">@keyframes</span> slide-to-left</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n  <span class=\"token selector\">to</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span> <span class=\"token property\">transform</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token function\">translateX</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>-100%<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n<span class=\"token atrule\"><span class=\"token rule\">@keyframes</span> slide-from-right</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n  <span class=\"token selector\">from</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span> <span class=\"token property\">transform</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token function\">translateX</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>100%<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></code></pre></div>\n<hr>\n<h2>⚠️ 8. 실무 함정 1: 레이아웃 스태킹 및 z-index context 꼬임 현상</h2>\n<p>가장 흔히 겪는 문제는 <code class=\"language-text\">view-transition-name</code>이 고유해야 한다는 점입니다. 한 화면 내에서 두 개 이상의 요소에 동일한 <code class=\"language-text\">view-transition-name</code>을 지정하면 트랜지션 전체가 무시되고 콘솔 에러가 발생합니다.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"javascript\"><pre class=\"language-javascript\"><code class=\"language-javascript\"><span class=\"token comment\">// ❌ 잘못된 예시: 반복문 안에서 동일한 name 지정</span>\nitems<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">map</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token parameter\">item</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=></span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>\n  <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span>div style<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span> <span class=\"token literal-property property\">viewTransitionName</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">'card-item'</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token operator\">></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>item<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>title<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span><span class=\"token operator\">/</span>div<span class=\"token operator\">></span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n\n<span class=\"token comment\">// ✅ 올바른 예시: 동적 고유 ID 부여</span>\nitems<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">map</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token parameter\">item</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=></span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>\n  <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span>div style<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span> <span class=\"token literal-property property\">viewTransitionName</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token template-string\"><span class=\"token template-punctuation string\">`</span><span class=\"token string\">card-item-</span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token interpolation-punctuation punctuation\">${</span>item<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>id<span class=\"token interpolation-punctuation punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token template-punctuation string\">`</span></span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token operator\">></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>item<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>title<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span><span class=\"token operator\">/</span>div<span class=\"token operator\">></span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span></code></pre></div>\n<p>또한 트랜지션 가상 요소 트리는 항상 Document 최상단 레이어에 오버레이 되므로, <code class=\"language-text\">overflow: hidden</code>이나 부모의 <code class=\"language-text\">z-index</code> 규칙을 무시할 수 있어 시각적 잘림 현상을 확인해야 합니다.</p>\n<hr>\n<h2>⚠️ 9. 실무 함정 2: 비동기 데이터 패칭 및 DOM 업데이트 타이밍 미스</h2>\n<p><code class=\"language-text\">startViewTransition</code>의 콜백 함수에서 Promise를 처리할 때, 비동기 로직이 완전히 종료될 때까지 브라우저는 화면을 스냅샷 캡처 대기 상태로 고정시킵니다.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"js\"><pre class=\"language-js\"><code class=\"language-js\"><span class=\"token comment\">// ❌ 안쁜 예시: 너무 긴 비동기 대기로 화면 Freeze 발생</span>\ndocument<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">startViewTransition</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token keyword\">async</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=></span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n  <span class=\"token keyword\">const</span> data <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">await</span> <span class=\"token function\">fetchLargeData</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span> <span class=\"token comment\">// 2초 소요 시 2초간 화면 완전 먹통</span>\n  <span class=\"token function\">renderUI</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>data<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n\n<span class=\"token comment\">// ✅ 올바른 예시: 데이터를 먼저 받아온 후 DOM 업데이트만 콜백으로 전달</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">const</span> data <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">await</span> <span class=\"token function\">fetchLargeData</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\ndocument<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">startViewTransition</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=></span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n  <span class=\"token function\">renderUI</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>data<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span></code></pre></div>\n<hr>\n<h2>🚫 10. 사용을 피해야 하는 상황과 성능 안티 패턴</h2>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>수백 개의 리스트 항목 전체에 <code class=\"language-text\">view-transition-name</code> 부여</strong>: 개별 캡처 스냅샷 레이어가 수백 개 생겨 GPU 메모리 폭증 및 프레임 드롭을 유발합니다.</li>\n<li><strong>실시간 데이터 스트리밍(Chart, Canvas)</strong>: 초당 수십 번 바뀌는 데이터 표시에 View Transition을 걸면 비동기 스냅샷이 꼬이게 됩니다.</li>\n<li><strong>인풋 키보드 입력 타이밍</strong>: 텍스트 입력 시마다 트랜지션을 실행하면 입력 딜레이(INP 저하)가 발생합니다.</li>\n</ol>\n<hr>\n<h2>🧭 11. 접근성(a11y)과 <code class=\"language-text\">prefers-reduced-motion</code> 대책</h2>\n<p>모션 시각 장애나 어지럼증을 느끼는 사용자를 위해 반드시 <code class=\"language-text\">prefers-reduced-motion</code> 미디어 쿼리를 적용해야 합니다.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"css\"><pre class=\"language-css\"><code class=\"language-css\"><span class=\"token atrule\"><span class=\"token rule\">@media</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token property\">prefers-reduced-motion</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> reduce<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span></span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n  <span class=\"token selector\">::view-transition-group(*),\n  ::view-transition-old(*),\n  ::view-transition-new(*)</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"token property\">animation</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> none <span class=\"token important\">!important</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></code></pre></div>\n<hr>\n<h2>🧾 12. 정리</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>View Transitions API는 브라우저 네이티브 수준의 스냅샷 애니메이션 메커니즘을 제공합니다.</li>\n<li><code class=\"language-text\">document.startViewTransition</code> 하나로 SPA의 DOM 변경을 부드럽게 이을 수 있습니다.</li>\n<li><code class=\"language-text\">view-transition-name</code>을 통해 서로 다른 페이지 간의 Hero 애니메이션을 무설정 수준으로 선언할 수 있습니다.</li>\n<li>고유한 name 관리, 비동기 데이터 처리 순서, <code class=\"language-text\">prefers-reduced-motion</code> 대응이 실무 적용의 핵심 키포인트입니다.</li>\n</ul>\n<blockquote>\n<p>✨ <strong>한 줄 요약</strong>\n무거운 JS 애니메이션 라이브러리를 내려놓고, 브라우저 가상 요소 스냅샷 기반의 View Transitions API로 부드러운 웹 경험을 구축하자!</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2>📚 참고 자료</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.w3.org/TR/css-view-transitions-1/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">W3C Draft: CSS View Transitions Module Level 1</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/View_Transitions_API\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">MDN Web Docs: View Transitions API</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://developer.chrome.com/docs/web-platform/view-transitions/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Chrome Dev: Smooth transitions with the View Transitions API</a></li>\n</ul>","frontmatter":{"title":"🎬 View Transitions API: SPA와 MPA를 아우르는 차세대 브라우저 애니메이션 혁명","summary":"화면 전환, 라이브러리 없이 브라우저 네이티브로 완전 정복","date":"2026.09.22.","categories":["Web"],"thumbnail":{"childImageSharp":{"gatsbyImageData":{"layout":"constrained","placeholder":{"fallback":"data:image/png;base64,"},"images":{"fallback":{"src":"/static/b1449165fad53e79a7e8d4bdb829b437/4d776/view-transitions-api-guide.png","srcSet":"/static/b1449165fad53e79a7e8d4bdb829b437/4a410/view-transitions-api-guide.png 384w,\n/static/b1449165fad53e79a7e8d4bdb829b437/f5189/view-transitions-api-guide.png 768w,\n/static/b1449165fad53e79a7e8d4bdb829b437/4d776/view-transitions-api-guide.png 1536w","sizes":"(min-width: 1536px) 1536px, 100vw"},"sources":[{"srcSet":"/static/b1449165fad53e79a7e8d4bdb829b437/b642b/view-transitions-api-guide.webp 384w,\n/static/b1449165fad53e79a7e8d4bdb829b437/c9564/view-transitions-api-guide.webp 768w,\n/static/b1449165fad53e79a7e8d4bdb829b437/18b4b/view-transitions-api-guide.webp 1536w","type":"image/webp","sizes":"(min-width: 1536px) 1536px, 100vw"}]},"width":1536,"height":1024}},"publicURL":"/static/b1449165fad53e79a7e8d4bdb829b437/view-transitions-api-guide.png"}}}}]}},"pageContext":{"slug":"/view-transitions-api-guide/"}},"staticQueryHashes":[],"slicesMap":{}}